# PATCH CONTEXT
# Prevent Android cards from briefly appearing without their inner shadows when
# switching Sports categories or replacing loading placeholders with cards.
#
# Make each drawing ready before its view draws. On Android, also prepare the
# area that displays it before the first frame, draw it once, and leave waiting
# frames for Android to display.
#
# The drawing update applies on all platforms; the display changes are Android-only.
# Keep the later redraw because child components can change drawing values after
# the first drawing is recorded.
#
# Verified on Pixel 6 / Android 14: 40 new views and six Sports category switches,
# including loading placeholders replaced by cards, showed shadows immediately.
# Patch-package applies this after 001+initial, which contains the earlier fixes.

